{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44681","headline":"和卢赞府游纪国道场 · 慧净","name":"和卢赞府游纪国道场","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日光通汉室，星彩晦周朝。\n法城从此构，香阁本迢嶢。\n株盘仰承露，刹凤俯摩霄。\n落照侵虚牖，长虹拖跨桥。\n高才暂骋目，云藻随飘颻。\n欲追千里骥，终是谢连镳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"慧净","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44681.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44681","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}